                            "steamid": "76561199520215770",
                            "num_reviews": 6,
                            "playtime_forever": 335,
                            "playtime_last_two_weeks": 66,
                            "playtime_at_review": 335,
                            "last_played": 1793639449
                        },
                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "WRC 4... What can I say... As a racing fan, the game can be challenging in some aspects. At first, I really enjoyed playing it. BUT in the career, the races are structured like this: A place where you tune the car or repair it, race, race, repair the car if it's broken, race, race, repair the car again, race, race. And at the end, the shortest time trial. The last time I played, I was already falling asleep... Maybe it's because I didn't get enough sleep that day. But still, the game is slowly getting boring. But that doesn't change my complete decision to quit this game. I'm just saying this as one factor, after the gameplay. If you want it, buy it, if you don't need it... Well... don't buy it then.",
